{"lyrics":"[Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro]\n[00:20.62]Diamonds dancing milly\n[Chorus]\n[00:23.66]In New York we countin' knots, livin’ at the top\n[00:26.66]AP on me, milly rock\n[00:28.08]Stick 50 in the Glock\n[00:29.60]Now we ridin' 'round the city\n[00:31.06]Sippin’ Wock' and playin' rock (Shit)\n[00:33.08]I just spilled my pop (Fuck)\n[00:34.50]Now I'm pissed off\n[00:35.62]Oh, you don't know what a Perc is? Them be my friends\n[00:38.50]They help me see all of the serpents\n[00:40.08]Perc' thirty, no tens\n[00:41.82]I took five, that's a fen', had me limpin’ like a pimp\n[00:44.66]You would never understand, it’s complicated, isn't simp—\n[Verse]\n[00:48.40]Life’s simple\n[00:49.82]He in my way, I could kill him (Brra), simple\n[00:52.76]I'm feelin' bad, pop a pill (Geekin'), simple\n[00:55.90]That’s the type of shit that be up on my mental (Mental)\n[00:59.98]Did I hear your demo? (Haha)\n[01:01.84]Nah, I must've not havе got the memo (Uh-uh)\n[01:04.72]Oh, you ain't know we keep thе lead like a pencil? (Brra)\n[01:07.62]This off the top by the way, I didn't use no pencil (Uh-uh)\n[01:10.68]These niggas just startin' to get their drip, lil' bitch, I been dope\n[01:13.64]When I hit that shit, I'ma rip that shit, make her let her friends know\n[01:16.64]Yeah, we keep them blicks, .45 or six, we let them shits blow (Brrt)\n[01:19.48]Like go go (Pop, pop), slow-mo, like woah-woah\n[01:24.58]I'm rich ho\n[01:25.66]Finna buy a diamond ring for my lil' bitch, make it official\n[01:28.66]Bringing out them big ol' guns\n[01:30.40]If it's war ho, let them fuck niggas know\n[01:33.12]NLMB comin' strong, this shit is forever\n[Chorus]\n[01:35.68]In New York we countin' knots, livin' at the top\n[01:38.66]AP on me, milly rock\n[01:40.00]Stick 50 in the Glock\n[01:41.60]Now we ridin' 'round the city\n[01:43.06]Sippin' Wock' and playin' rock (Shit)\n[01:45.02]I just spilled my pop (Fuck)\n[01:46.50]Now I'm pissed off\n[01:47.66]Oh, you don't know what a Perc is? Them be my f